capital run at 11% against a 8% cost of capital, which means the business barely earns its keep economically.","The company is burning through $6.8B of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","On the balance sheet, debt is heavy at 5.2\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and leverage like that is what turns a bad year into a permanent loss, and interest coverage runs at 3.5\u00d7.","Shareholder yield is only 1.4%, a thin return of capital, and insiders hold 2.6% of the shares, and within its sector the business captures 3.4\u00d7 its fair share of profits, a structural advantage visible in the numbers."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (1.2) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Very elevated short interest (68.1% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting against the business","sev":"red","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Carries a 35% premium to sector median EV/EBITDA","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.35316891310582155},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $127.7M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"Value-trap profile (score 58/100): leveraged balance sheet under pressure; durably derated by the market \u2014 cheapness may reflect deterioration, not mispricing","sev":"amber","cat":"value_trap"},{"text":"Carries more leverage than most Energy peers \u2014 a smaller cushion for the inevitable bad year","sev":"amber","cat":"balance_sheet"},{"text":"The commodity cycle \u2014 revenue and free cash flow are ultimately hostage to a price the company does not set, and the long-run energy-transition arc adds a structural overhang.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"ESG-driven capital flight and stranded asset risk \u2014 tightening climate policy and investor mandates raise the cost of capital and risk leaving reserves permanently in the ground.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Geopolitical supply shocks \u2014 wars, sanctions, and OPEC decisions create volatility that no hedging programme can fully neutralise.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Reinvestment rate supports 11% organic growth capacity \u2014 capital is compounding inside the business","Operating margins 22% above sector median \u2014 the quantitative trace of pricing power","Trading at a 49% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","Healthy payout ratio leaves room for both dividend growth and reinvestment","Energy sector outperforming the broader market over the past quarter","Energy ETF in a sustained uptrend above its long-term average"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Surging Earnings Estimates Signal Upside for Venture Global (VG) Stock","source":"zacks.com","link":"https://www.zacks.com/stock/news/3029742/surging-earnings-estimates-signal-upside-for-venture-global-vg-stock?cid=CS-ZC-FT-fundamental_analysis%7Cyseop_template_8-3029742","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794586801.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Venture Global (NYSE:VG) Wins An Upgrade: Can LNG Keep Flowing?","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/news/market-updates/venture-global-nysevg-wins-an-upgrade-can-lng-keep-flowing","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794582240.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.612,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["analyst_action"]},{"title":"Wall Street Analysts See a 31.98% Upside in Venture Global (VG): Can the Stock Really Move This High?","source":"zacks.com","link":"https://www.zacks.com/stock/news/3029546/wall-street-analysts-see-a-31-98-upside-in-venture-global-vg-can-the-stock-really-move-this-high?cid=CS-ZC-FT-fundamental_analysis%7Cconsensus_price_target-3